{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/fefd46b06b571312c21cfe8a64bdc9c7.poster.avif?t=1763300087\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/fefd46b06b571312c21cfe8a64bdc9c7.webm?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/fefd46b06b571312c21cfe8a64bdc9c7.mp4?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Cards</strong> is a truly unique and innovative card game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelike deck builder, every card is unique. Cards are generated randomly based on defined rules, creating an endless number of possible cards to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Focus on Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play units, relics, or spells to overwhelm your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong synergies between cards lead to deep gameplay with countless tactical options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a commander with unique abilities that shape your strategy, and unlock new commanders as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/ab1504dcaf7512153dae6a79f76aaf55.poster.avif?t=1763300087\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/ab1504dcaf7512153dae6a79f76aaf55.webm?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/ab1504dcaf7512153dae6a79f76aaf55.mp4?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression and Deck Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you advance in a run, the stronger your card rewards become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This creates a dynamic experience where you keep evolving your deck until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to completely free deck building, you can add or remove cards at any time to perfectly adjust your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/e964de5f5f5f1f8929caa9db3d278f83.poster.avif?t=1763300087\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/e964de5f5f5f1f8929caa9db3d278f83.webm?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/e964de5f5f5f1f8929caa9db3d278f83.mp4?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite cards and massive replay value</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner friendly with interactive tutorial</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate optional modifiers for even more challenging runs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, tactical gameplay through complex card synergies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ commanders with unique playstyles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ factions: Play as humans, dragons, skeletons, and many more</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 locations with their own enemies and bosses across 5 difficulty tiers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy, create, and upgrade cards during your run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully flexible deck building: Add or remove cards at any time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional puzzle challenges for strategists</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For tacticians and puzzle fans, the game offers a special puzzle mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a preset battlefield and win in just a few turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for exploring new combinations and card synergies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3833300?t=1763300087","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/7679776c3e719512d2f41bf448fa911b219bdf42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763300087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/7ed25f5a4af159ab55abbb5b237bd7e3d8ddd9e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763300087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/7ed25f5a4af159ab55abbb5b237bd7e3d8ddd9e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763300087","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut