g</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you advance in a run, the stronger your card rewards become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This creates a dynamic experience where you keep evolving your deck until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to completely free deck building, you can add or remove cards at any time to perfectly adjust your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/e964de5f5f5f1f8929caa9db3d278f83.poster.avif?t=1763300087\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/e964de5f5f5f1f8929caa9db3d278f83.webm?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/extras/e964de5f5f5f1f8929caa9db3d278f83.mp4?t=1763300087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite cards and massive replay value</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner friendly with interactive tutorial</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate optional modifiers for even more challenging runs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, tactical gameplay through complex card synergies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ commanders with unique playstyles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ factions: Play as humans, dragons, skeletons, and many more</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 locations with their own enemies and bosses across 5 difficulty tiers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy, create, and upgrade cards during your run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully flexible deck building: Add or remove cards at any time</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional puzzle challenges for strategists</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For tacticians and puzzle fans, the game offers a special puzzle mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a preset battlefield and win in just a few turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for exploring new combinations and card synergies.</p>","developers":["Tubby Turtle Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833300/7b40b16c9f375671e1f77fd15628ea9ccf4b9d4a/header.jpg?t=1763300087","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833300/1199934951/1dd626c7efeee013aa3886f000f523ce9f71cdb5/1753719795/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753968630","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833300/1199934951/1dd626c7efeee013aa3886f000f523ce9f71cdb5/1753719795/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753968630","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3833300/1199934951/1dd626c7efeee013aa3886f000f523ce9f71cdb5/1753719795/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753968630","id":257174947,"name":"Infinite Cards - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174947/f151e325b2da4e942aa4290771b92836e604e9aa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753968630"}],"name":"Infinite Cards","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core Intel or